  "docs.threeD.advReduceCap": "智能拓扑/减面",
  "docs.threeD.advReduceDesc": "对模型做布线规整与降面。input_model_url 传 OBJ/GLB,parameters.polygon_type 选三角/四边面,parameters.face_level 选 high/medium/low 控制目标面数档位。",
  "docs.threeD.advPartCap": "组件生成",
